      "description": "All measurements taken with Modular Compact Series of Anton Paar AG rheometer at Institut für Transport- und Automatisierungstechnik (ITA) of the Leibniz Universität Hannover (LUH).\r\n\r\nAll measurements taken by Lennart Mesecke @IPeG under supervision of Tobias Biermann @IPeG.\r\n\r\nAll measurements taken at roomtemperature R_T=20°C.\r\n\r\nDataset contains:\r\n\r\nDOWSIL-EI1184-Rheology-Viscosity-00min to 90min => Rotational measurements to determine viscosity at different timepoints (00 to 90min) for understanding curing behaviour of the two component material.\r\n\r\nDOWSIL-El1184-Rheology-Oscillatory-00min => Oscillatory measurements at 00min curing time for determining storage and loss modulus.",
